产业链哪环、与正宗核心同业比如何\"，覆盖技术面+资金流+基本面+叙事逻辑。内部研究版（点名个股、给关键价位）。所有结论必须基于 tdx/westock/neodata 真实数据，禁凭记忆编造。输出自然语言诊断报告 + ECharts HTML 看板（真实K线/资金流/重估雷达/同业对比/产业链价值/证据审计）。", "downloads": 0, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_913f118d/stock-deep-diagnosis", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/f7fabcfa-0496-4dc7-9258-df9b7c751850.png", "installs": 0, "isServiceized": false, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "个股深度诊断", "namespace": null, "ownerName": "user_913f118d", "score": 0, "slug": "stock-deep-diagnosis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "pro-finance", "name": "金融分析"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1786280868096, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.3"}]}